Your only task is to produce five valid compact rating vectors.

Return a single JSON object with exactly these five string keys: "0", "1", "2", "3", "4".
Do not return any other key or any nested object.
Each string must contain exactly 27 numeric score:confidence pairs.
Use one colon inside each pair and one semicolon between pairs.
Each vector must contain exactly 27 colons and 26 semicolons.
Scores are 0-100. Confidences are 0-1.
